<h1>Dewy <em>dogfood</em> notes</h1>
<p>This is a <strong>small</strong> converter. It handles <code>code</code>, <em>emphasis</em> and <a href="https://example.com/a?b=1&c=2">links</a>.</p>
<h2>Lists</h2>
<ul>
  <li>first item</li>
  <li>second with <strong>bold</strong></li>
  <li>third</li>
</ul>
<ol>
  <li>one</li>
  <li>two &lt; three</li>
</ol>
<h3>Edge cases</h3>
<p>Unclosed <em>emphasis and a lone ` backtick.</em></p>
